  "naukri": {
    "actor": "muhammetakkurtt~naukri-job-scraper",
    "_enabled": true,
    "_cost_usd": 0.006,
    "_always_run": true,
    "_help": "India only. Very cheap (billed per job returned, ~$0.0015/job), so it runs every day (_always_run). maxJobs must be at least 50. experience = years you have. Without \"cities\" it searches all of India and the city rules in profile.json do the filtering. To search only your cities, add \"cities\": [\"<id>\", ...] using Naukri's numeric city ids (shown in the actor's input form on Apify).",
